        <activityName xml:lang="en">Horse dung and wood chips, burned in furnace, ash to municipal incineration</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Horse dung and wood chips, burned in furnace, ash to municipal incineration
Air emission data completed with the inventory of wood chips, from forest, mixed, burned in furnace 1000kW;
UUID: 5131b814-999f-3b4f-bce8-7c533379f96c
This data set includes fuel, infrastructure, ash disposal and air emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: grate firing 500-600 kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5131b814-999f-3b4f-bce8-7c533379f96c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
